# Files that end up inside the Linux ramdisk and the image keep LF line endings, also on Windows
# checkouts (the image build strips CRs as a safety net too).
* text=auto eol=lf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
prebuilt/** binary
# A release zip (git archive) fills in the commit and its time: the zip has no Git.
headset.json export-subst
